The angular momentum such a beam may carry is quantized by the *Alexander
polynomial* of that knot. For the torus-knot family $T(2,n)$ this polynomial is
the alternating sum $A_n(X) = 1 - X + X^2 - \cdots + X^{n-1}$, and its roots are
the allowed OAM channels.

